{'symbol': 'NI', 'date': '2023-03-10 08:00:00', 'title': 'BRENT ARCHER TO RETIRE FROM NISOURCE', 'text': 'JENNIFER MONTAGUE APPOINTED PRESIDENT AND CHIEF OPERATING OFFICER, COLUMBIA GAS OF VIRGINIA MERRILLVILLE, IND. , MARCH 10, 2023 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- NISOURCE (NYSE: NI)\xa0TODAY ANNOUNCED THE APPOINTMENT OF JENNIFER MONTAGUE TO THE ROLE OF PRESIDENT AND CHIEF OPERATING OFFICER, COLUMBIA GAS OF VIRGINIA, EFFECTIVE MAY 1, FOLLOWING THE RETIREMENT OF BRENT ARCHER.'}